<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Panmure picks stocks for 1997.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Panmure picks stocks for 1997.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Panmure Gordon on Tuesday named nine stocks it regards as the &quot;main buys&quot; for 1997 and six it advises to &quot;sell&quot;.  </p>
<p>Among Panmure Gordon's preferred stocks are British Land Co, Commercial Union, General Electric Co, LASMO Plc, National Westminster Bank, Peninsular and Oriental Steam Navigation, Rank Group Plc, Reed International Plc and Smiths Industries.</p>
